      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wallsburg%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name honors William Madison Wall, a North Carolina native who helped build the road through Provo Canyon.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
