      ],
      "source": "https://onlineutah.us/wallsburghistory.shtml"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Wallsburg sits on U‑282, just four miles southeast of Deer Creek Reservoir, making it a quiet agricultural hub.",
